  "description": "Recurring billing for the Tnzi.NET payment module: plans, subscriptions, trials, proration on plan change, unattended off-session renewal, dunning and renewal reminders. Optional - a host that only charges once at checkout never carries the three Payment_ subscription tables, twenty-six endpoints or four permission codes. Without it the payment module charges, refunds and reconciles exactly as before; it simply has no notion of a recurring customer.",
